{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10411","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 七 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱流自兹远，倚檝时一望。\n遥见楚汉城，崔嵬高山上。\n天道昔未测，人心无所向。\n屠钓称侯王，龙蛇争霸王。\n缅怀多杀戮，顾此生惨怆。\n圣代休甲兵，吾其得闲放。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}